# Lockfile: pinning committed for binary apps is the modern recommendation
# (https://blog.rust-lang.org/2024/04/09/Rust-1.77.0.html#cargo-locks-in-binary-projects)
# but for a fresh repo, ignoring it avoids committing the dep resolution.
# Flip this commit-include when you start collaborating with another dev.
/Cargo.lock

